 $ is given by\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{csc}⁡x\\in (-\\infty ,-1]\\cup [1,\\infty ).\n$$\n\nSo, the equation $\\operatorname{csc}⁡x=k$ has no solutions for $k\\in (-1,1).$ \n\nTherefore, of the given equations, only equation I has no solutions."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186403286 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186087695 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "ddb59990-7419-585f-aa1b-901d59c8cfc1" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying a Zero Matrix" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048252 :topic/id #uuid "8c876864-a853-56d6-a887-91d7f8f1cf14" :topic/math-academy-id 862 :topic/title "Zero, Square, Diagonal and Identity Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2831831b-90bb-5362-9c18-837ed3914d98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473218} {:answer/id #uuid "46b3e7ae-cf4d-5f01-abe9-eb51d545a48a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473219}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2831831b-90bb-5362-9c18-837ed3914d98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473218} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b706434-e109-54bb-b3f3-e1c6a8046502" :answer-field/key "P" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474004} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4b828f2c-8db4-5a22-bd3c-299c9fd4c109" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473220} {:answer/id #uuid "662a72f0-da36-516a-a3b8-7c6e6e08bdd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473221}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "662a72f0-da36-516a-a3b8-7c6e6e08bdd3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186