_{8}$\n\nIII. $[6]_{8}$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "We have $5\\in [a]_{8}$ if \n\n$$\n5≡a\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8).\n$$\n\nLet's now consider each of the given equivalence classes.\n\n- $5\\in [-3]_{8}$ because $5≡-3\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\in [13]_{8}$ because $5≡13\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,✓$\n\n- $5\\notin [6]_{8}$ because $5≢6\\,(\\text{mod}\\,8)$ $\\,\\times $\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"I and II only\"."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186412970 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186152098 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "9c1fe7ea-d91e-5440-b756-37a460a18f19" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Residue Classes Containing a Given Element" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050597 :topic/id #uuid "574a92ea-12bd-55d4-a248-945298d922a1" :topic/math-academy-id 2655 :topic/title "Residue Classes"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32678fbc-f157-5a57-81fd-d7a79981aea5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473506} {:answer/id #uuid "3cc9c076-0c81-5b27-b973-32b9a3a20f22" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473507}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "32678fbc-f157-5a57-81fd-d7a79981aea5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473506} :answer-field/id #uuid "21bb7e33-ef96-5e03-890b-a1f89c07ae98" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186474148} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "ec9d0667-f924-5b3f-9f06-3a0a7dad6192" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186473508} {:answer/id #uuid "5f0043ff-a8a0-5d1e-9a7e-014abbc4cfc1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/re